# Shared field PvP self-sustain: instant items first, healing agents, PvP buffs kept up, swing based weapon swap.
# Needs: the heal pot and reflect bars, and a swing N bar (WeaponSwing type) for each enabled weapon slot.
# Turn it on when a PvP fight starts. All offense stays manual: attack spells, TK, explosion potions,
# pets, targeting and melee requests. The script never cuts a manual cast or cursor.
# No start 4 lines (conventions 02.D, config__clear_at_start 0): a manual cursor or cast held at Play is kept.
# Arm/Dress must remove conflicting equipment.
# Design and in-game checks: blueprint/pvp.html part 5.E, blueprint/open-items.html part 10.
#
# Shape
#   Each block reads the live state and acts on the spot, the way bard-necro-enhanced and
#   lumberjack-enhanced do. No block hands a decision to a later one. Item uses go through
#   Razor's object delay queue, and every block waits while that queue is busy. A cast block
#   waits out its own cast in a for 60 poll, so the next block sees casting end.
#
# Input rules (wiki Combat Overview, blueprint/pvp.html part 5.B)
#   Potions and the pouch are instant and go out while a spell is casting.
#   Drinking with a finished precast cursor in hand cancels that spell, so a potion or a
#   bandage waits while any cursor is held. Agents and buffs need no cast and no cursor.
#   Only our own buff cast is cut, at config__buff_max_loss, so the next pass can heal.
#   No walk guard (config__walk_guard 0): in a fight there is no better moment to wait for.
#
# Cost (blueprint/razor.html part 6)
#   findtype is the most expensive statement. Reagents are read in REAGENTS every
#   cooldown__reagents and right after a "More reagents are needed" refusal, and the cast
#   blocks read the flags. Potions are looked up only inside a block that already needs one.
# Hotkeys: Drink Cure, > Smart Heal/Cure Self, Drink Heal, > Greater Heal/Cure Self,
#          Cancel Current Target, Bandage Self, Drink Refresh, Drink Strength, Drink Agility,
#          Drink Magic Resist, > Interrupt.
# Generated from recipe/pvp-recipe.razor by util/build-scripts.py. Edit module/ and recipe/, not this file.


# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################

# ---- module/base.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1 shows the optional overheads. Warnings show either way.
@setvar! config__chatty 1

# 1 writes Journal diagnostics. A block that writes one says so in its comments.
@setvar! config__sysmsg 1

# What Play does first (conventions 02.D).
#   0  nothing: a cursor or a cast the player holds at Play is kept
#   1  clear the client queues, the journal and the ignore list
# This loop: A manual cursor or cast held at Play is kept (conventions 02.D).
@setvar! config__clear_at_start 0

# 1 uses Magery: the Cure and heal agents, the reagent reads and the buffs.
# At 0 potions and bandages still go out.
@setvar! config__use_magery 1

# 1 uses potions: cure, heal, Refresh and the stat potions.
@setvar! config__use_potions 1

# Our casts and the walk bar.
#   0  cast while walking, for a fight where there is no better moment to wait for
#   1  wait while the walk bar runs, so a step does not break the cast
# This loop: pvp casts while walking: in a fight there is no better moment to wait for.
@setvar! config__walk_guard 0

# Whose warmode it is.
#   0  ours: our casts ignore it
#   1  the player's manual control window: our casts and the food stand down while it
#      is on. Potions and bandages still go out
@setvar! config__warmode_is_manual 0


# ---- module/recovery/cure.razor ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Minimum current mana for the Cure agent.
@setvar! config__mana_cure 6


# ---- module/recovery/heal.razor ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Missing hit points (not percent) that drink a heal potion.
@setvar! config__heal_hits 35

# Missing hit points that cast Greater Heal when no heal potion went out on this pass.
# Not below heal_hits.
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 35

# Minimum current mana for Greater Heal. It keeps no reserve: 31 always leaves 20 mana for
# an attack or Teleport.
@setvar! config__mana_greater_heal 11


# ---- module/recovery/bandage.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------

# 1 uses bandages. At 0 recovery/light-heal stands in.
@setvar! config__use_bandages 1

# Healing must be above this to bandage. At or below it recovery/light-heal stands in.
@setvar! config__heal_skill_min 0


# ---- module/recovery/light-heal.razor ------------------------------------------------------------

# When the light Heal goes.
#   0  only while no bandage can run: use_bandages 0, Healing at or below heal_skill_min,
#      or none left and none running
#   1  beside the bandages too
@setvar! config__use_light_heal 0

# Missing hit points that start the light Heal.
@setvar! config__light_hits 15

# Minimum current mana for the light Heal.
@setvar! config__mana_heal 4


# ---- module/recovery/refresh.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Current stamina at or below this drinks a Refresh.
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 15


# ---- module/buff/potions.razor -------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1 keeps the Magic Resist potion up.
@setvar! config__use_resist_potion 1

# STR with the Greater Strength potion on: your base plus 20. Below it the potion is drunk,
# and 0 turns it off. Bless and the Strength spell, ours or an ally's, show the same icon as
# the potion but add less than its 20, so the stat tells them apart.
# This loop: The loop is shared, so set this for the character that runs it.
@setvar! config__str_potion 120

# DEX with the Greater Agility potion on: your base plus 20. Below it the potion is drunk,
# and 0 turns it off. Bless and the Agility spell show the same icon, as for STR.
@setvar! config__dex_potion 100


# ---- module/buff/spells.razor --------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1 keeps Reactive Armor up.
@setvar! config__use_reactive_armor 1

# 1 keeps Magic Reflection up.
@setvar! config__use_magic_reflect 1

# Minimum current mana to start Reactive Armor.
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 4

# Minimum current mana to start Magic Reflection.
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 14

# Missing hit points at which buffs are not started, and cut mid cast.
# This loop: Keep this equal to config__emergency_hits.
@setvar! config__buff_max_loss 35

# Buffs while poisoned.
#   0  no: hold them back and cut one that is casting, so the cure goes first
#   1  yes
@setvar! config__buff_when_poisoned 1


# ---- module/fight/weapon-swap.razor --------------------------------------------------------------

# Weapon graphic for each slot. Slot N reads the "swing N" bar, and 0 turns the slot off.
# A slot whose swing is ready wins, 4 down to 1. With none ready and both hands empty, the
# lowest enabled slot re-arms.
@setvar! config__weapon_1_graphic 31128
@setvar! config__weapon_2_graphic 0
@setvar! config__weapon_3_graphic 0
@setvar! config__weapon_4_graphic 31190


# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################

# ---- module/base.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The poll inside a wait.
@setvar! wait__poll 100

# The pause after an action.
@setvar! wait__short 200

# Spacing for repeated warnings. Without it an empty potion bag shouts every pass.
@setvar! cooldown__message 3000


# ---- module/recovery/reagents.razor --------------------------------------------------------------

# Reagent read interval. Five lookups each time. A refill counts within this, and running out
# is caught at once by the refusal line.
@setvar! cooldown__reagents 10000


# ---- module/buff/potions.razor -------------------------------------------------------------------

# A Strength or Agility potion is tried once per window. The stat arrives a round trip after the
# drink, and a Curse, Weaken or Clumsy can hold it under the line while the potion still runs:
# without the window that refused drink would go out every pass. An empty bag is looked up at
# the same pace.
@setvar! cooldown__stat_potion 5000


# ####################################################################################
# # TIMER
# ####################################################################################

# ---- module/base.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ready on the first pass, so the first warning shows at once.
if not timerexists "timer__message"
    createtimer "timer__message"
endif
settimer "timer__message" cooldown__message


# ---- module/recovery/reagents.razor --------------------------------------------------------------

# Ready on the first pass, so reagents are read before the first cast.
if not timerexists "timer__reagents"
    createtimer "timer__reagents"
endif
settimer "timer__reagents" cooldown__reagents


# ---- module/buff/potions.razor -------------------------------------------------------------------

if not timerexists "timer__str_potion"
    createtimer "timer__str_potion"
endif
settimer "timer__str_potion" cooldown__stat_potion

if not timerexists "timer__agi_potion"
    createtimer "timer__agi_potion"
endif
settimer "timer__agi_potion" cooldown__stat_potion


# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################

# ---- module/base.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Signals between blocks. Each keeps the value here unless the loop has a block that sets it.

# 1 while an enemy is engaged. buff/potions drinks only then.
# fight/target sets it every pass, and the pvp recipe keeps it at 1.
@setvar! var__fighting 0

# 1 while a block keeps the cast window for itself. buff/spells stands down.
# escape/recall sets it once a Recall is due.
@setvar! var__hold_casts 0

# 1 while gathering and its packing wait. escape/recall sets it.
@setvar! var__hold_gathering 0


# ---- module/recovery/reagents.razor --------------------------------------------------------------

# Reagent flags, written only by REAGENTS. 1 when every reagent of that spell was found.
#   Cure            garlic 3972, ginseng 3973
#   Heal            garlic, ginseng, silk 3981
#   Greater Heal    garlic, ginseng, silk, mandrake 3974
#   Reactive Armor  garlic, silk, ash 3980
#   Reflection      garlic, silk, mandrake
@setvar! var__regs_cure 0
@setvar! var__regs_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
@setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0

# Scratch: 1 when that reagent was found on the last read.
@setvar! var__has_garlic 0
@setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
@setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
@setvar! var__has_ash 0
@setvar! var__has_silk 0


# ---- module/recovery/heal.razor ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Scratch: 1 once a heal potion went out on this pass.
@setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0


# ---- module/recovery/light-heal.razor ------------------------------------------------------------

# Scratch: 1 when the light Heal goes on this pass.
@setvar! var__light_heal_due 0


# ---- module/fight/weapon-swap.razor --------------------------------------------------------------

# The weapon this script armed last, kept across Plays. Only own items. See WEAPON.
if not varexist var__weapon_armed_serial
    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_serial 0
endif
if not varexist var__weapon_armed_graphic
    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_graphic 0
endif

# Scratch: the slot graphic wanted on this pass, 0 for none.
@setvar! var__weapon_want 0

# Scratch: 1 when the armed serial is in a hand.
@setvar! var__weapon_held 0


# ---- recipe/pvp-recipe.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# pvp is always in a fight, so the stat potions are kept up the whole time.
@setvar! var__fighting 1


# ---- module/base.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The pvp expression means the structured-PvP restrictions, where these loops may not run.
if pvp
    overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
    stop
endif

if config__clear_at_start = 1
    clearall
    clearsysmsg
    cleardragdrop
    clearignore
endif


# ---- recipe/pvp-recipe.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------------

overhead "[ pvp, on ]" 290
if config__sysmsg = 1
    sysmsg "PvP sustain v9 loaded. Manual offense, recovery first." 88
endif


# ####################################################################################
# # MAIN LOOP
# ####################################################################################
while not dead
    # ---- module/base.razor -----------------------------------------------------------------------
    # The pvp expression means structured-PvP restrictions, not a field PK encounter.
    if pvp
        overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 254
        stop
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/reagents.razor ----------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # REAGENTS
    # ################################################################################
    # On the interval, or at once after a refusal for reagents, so a stale flag cannot send the
    # same doomed cast every pass.
    if config__use_magery = 1
        if timer "timer__reagents" >= cooldown__reagents or insysmsg "More reagents are needed"
            settimer "timer__reagents" 0

            @setvar! var__has_garlic 0
            @setvar! var__has_ginseng 0
            @setvar! var__has_mandrake 0
            @setvar! var__has_ash 0
            @setvar! var__has_silk 0

            if findtype 3972 self
                @setvar! var__has_garlic 1
            endif
            if findtype 3973 self
                @setvar! var__has_ginseng 1
            endif
            if findtype 3974 self
                @setvar! var__has_mandrake 1
            endif
            if findtype 3980 self
                @setvar! var__has_ash 1
            endif
            if findtype 3981 self
                @setvar! var__has_silk 1
            endif

            @setvar! var__regs_cure 0
            @setvar! var__regs_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
            @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 0

            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_cure 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_heal 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_ginseng = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_ash = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 1
            endif
            if var__has_garlic = 1 and var__has_silk = 1 and var__has_mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_magic_reflect 1
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/pouch.razor -------------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # PARALYZE
    # ################################################################################
    # Nothing else can act while held, so the pouch goes out at once, as in bard-necro-enhanced.
    if paralyzed
        if findtype 3705 backpack 38
            yell "[Pouch"
            wait wait__short
        elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ pouch, out ]" 254
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/cure.razor --------------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # CURE
    # ################################################################################
    # Potion first, it is instant and has no cooldown, and it goes out during a cast. While any
    # cure potion is carried the agent is not used, so mana stays for Greater Heal. The agent
    # waits for the walk bar and for warmode as config__walk_guard and config__warmode_is_manual say.
    if poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if config__use_potions = 1 and findtype "Orange Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Cure"
            wait wait__short
        else
            if config__use_potions = 1 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ cure pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif

            if config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_cure = 1 and mana >= config__mana_cure and not casting
                if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                    if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                        hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Agent: Smart Heal/Cure Self for poison." 88
                        endif
                        wait wait__short

                        for 60
                            if not casting
                                break
                            endif
                            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/heal.razor --------------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # Heavy damage drinks first, because the potion is instant and goes out during a cast.
    # Greater Heal follows when no potion went out on this pass and the loss is at the
    # emergency line: none carried, on its own cooldown, or the bar still running.
    # The bar skips the label read while it runs. The label stays authoritative when the bar
    # is missing. Greater Heal waits for the walk bar and for warmode as config__walk_guard and
    # config__warmode_is_manual say.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and diffhits >= config__heal_hits
        @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 0
        if config__use_potions = 1 and cooldown "heal pot" = 0
            if findtype "Yellow Potion" self as alias__heal_potion
                getlabel alias__heal_potion label__heal_potion
                if "next usable" in label__heal_potion
                    # Still on its own cooldown.
                else
                    hotkey "Drink Heal"
                    @setvar! var__heal_potion_out 1
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ heal pot, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif

        if var__heal_potion_out = 0 and diffhits >= config__emergency_hits and config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_greater_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_greater_heal and not casting
            if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                    hotkey "> Greater Heal/Cure Self"
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Agent: Greater Heal/Cure Self." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short

                    for 60
                        if not casting
                            break
                        endif
                        if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor

                    # The agent leaves its beneficial cursor up when there is nothing left to heal.
                    if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                        hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/bandage.razor -----------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # BANDAGE
    # ################################################################################
    # Never restarts a running bandage, and full health does not start one. Its target cursor
    # would replace a held precast, so it waits while any cursor is up.
    if config__use_bandages = 1 and not bandaging and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists and skill "Healing" > config__heal_skill_min
        if diffhits > 0 or poisoned
            if findtype 3617 self
                hotkey "Bandage Self"
                wait wait__short
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ bandage, out ]" 254
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/light-heal.razor --------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # LIGHT HEAL
    # ################################################################################
    # The bandage stand-in whenever no bandage can run: bandages off, no Healing, or none left
    # and none running. Beside the bandages only with config__use_light_heal 1. The agent waits
    # for the walk bar and for warmode as config__walk_guard and config__warmode_is_manual say.
    if not poisoned and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and config__use_magery = 1 and var__regs_heal = 1 and diffhits >= config__light_hits and mana >= config__mana_heal
        @setvar! var__light_heal_due 0
        if config__use_light_heal = 1 or config__use_bandages = 0 or skill "Healing" <= config__heal_skill_min
            @setvar! var__light_heal_due 1
        elseif not bandaging and not findtype 3617 self
            @setvar! var__light_heal_due 1
        endif

        if var__light_heal_due = 1
            if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                    hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "Agent: Smart Heal/Cure Self, light Heal." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short

                    for 60
                        if not casting
                            break
                        endif
                        if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor

                    if targetexists "beneficial" and diffhits = 0
                        hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/recovery/refresh.razor -----------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # REFRESH
    # ################################################################################
    if stam <= config__refresh_stam and config__use_potions = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if findtype "Red Potion" self
            hotkey "Drink Refresh"
            wait wait__short
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/buff/potions.razor ---------------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # STAT POTIONS
    # ################################################################################
    # Kept up while var__fighting is 1. Strength and Agility read the stat against config__str_potion
    # and config__dex_potion, because Bless and the Strength and Agility spells show the same
    # icons as the potions, and each is tried once per cooldown__stat_potion. Magic Resist has an
    # icon of its own and is drunk once it is missing. Each potion is judged on its own, so
    # running out of one does not hold up the others.
    if var__fighting = 1 and config__use_potions = 1 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not targetexists
        if not queued and str < config__str_potion and timer "timer__str_potion" >= cooldown__stat_potion
            settimer "timer__str_potion" 0
            if findtype "White Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Strength"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
        if not queued and dex < config__dex_potion and timer "timer__agi_potion" >= cooldown__stat_potion
            settimer "timer__agi_potion" 0
            if findtype "Blue Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Agility"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
        if config__use_resist_potion = 1 and not queued and not findbuff "Magic Resist Potion"
            if findtype "Black Potion" self
                hotkey "Drink Magic Resist"
                wait wait__short
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/buff/spells.razor ----------------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # SELF BUFFS
    # ################################################################################
    # Reactive Armor, then Magic Reflection, whenever one is missing and the window is free.
    # Not started at config__buff_max_loss, and cut there mid cast so the next pass can heal.
    # With config__buff_when_poisoned 0 poison holds them back and cuts them too, so the cure
    # goes first. var__hold_casts lets another block keep the cast window (a latched Recall).
    # config__walk_guard and config__warmode_is_manual apply as for the heal agents. The reflect
    # bar is the server's recast lock after Reflect is used up.
    if config__use_magery = 1 and var__hold_casts = 0 and not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and diffhits < config__buff_max_loss
        if config__buff_when_poisoned = 1 or not poisoned
            if config__warmode_is_manual = 0 or not warmode
                if config__walk_guard = 0 or cooldown "walk" = 0
                    if config__use_reactive_armor = 1 and var__regs_reactive_armor = 1 and mana >= config__mana_reactive_armor and not findbuff "Reactive Armor"
                        cast "Reactive Armor"
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Buff: Reactive Armor." 88
                        endif
                        wait wait__short

                        for 60
                            if not casting
                                break
                            endif
                            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                                break
                            endif
                            if diffhits >= config__buff_max_loss
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            if config__buff_when_poisoned = 0 and poisoned
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    elseif config__use_magic_reflect = 1 and var__regs_magic_reflect = 1 and mana >= config__mana_magic_reflect and cooldown "reflect" = 0 and not findbuff "Magic Reflection"
                        cast "Magic Reflection"
                        if config__sysmsg = 1
                            sysmsg "Buff: Magic Reflection." 88
                        endif
                        wait wait__short

                        for 60
                            if not casting
                                break
                            endif
                            if insysmsg "Your concentration is disturbed, thus ruining thy spell."
                                break
                            endif
                            if diffhits >= config__buff_max_loss
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            if config__buff_when_poisoned = 0 and poisoned
                                hotkey "> Interrupt"
                                break
                            endif
                            wait wait__poll
                        endfor
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/fight/weapon-swap.razor ----------------------------------------------------------
    # ################################################################################
    # # WEAPON
    # ################################################################################
    # Wanted slot: the highest enabled slot whose swing bar is ready, 4 down to 1. With none
    # ready and both hands empty, the lowest enabled slot. A missing bar reads ready.
    # The armed serial is searched only when the wanted slot changes, so a steady pass costs two
    # hand reads. A weapon already in hand is adopted without a request. Arming during a cast
    # would interrupt it (wiki Combat Overview), so this waits for a free window.
    # The equip request is not proof of a swing.
    if not paralyzed and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
        @setvar! var__weapon_want 0
        if config__weapon_4_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 4" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_4_graphic
        elseif config__weapon_3_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 3" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_3_graphic
        elseif config__weapon_2_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 2" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_2_graphic
        elseif config__weapon_1_graphic != 0 and cooldown "swing 1" = 0
            @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_1_graphic
        elseif lhandempty and rhandempty
            if config__weapon_1_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_1_graphic
            elseif config__weapon_2_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_2_graphic
            elseif config__weapon_3_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_3_graphic
            elseif config__weapon_4_graphic != 0
                @setvar! var__weapon_want config__weapon_4_graphic
            endif
        endif

        if var__weapon_want != 0
            if var__weapon_armed_graphic != var__weapon_want
                @setvar! var__weapon_armed_graphic var__weapon_want
                @setvar! var__weapon_armed_serial 0
                if findtype var__weapon_want self as alias__own_weapon
                    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_serial alias__own_weapon
                endif
            endif

            @setvar! var__weapon_held 0
            if findlayer self lefthand as alias__held_left
                if alias__held_left = var__weapon_armed_serial
                    @setvar! var__weapon_held 1
                endif
            endif
            if findlayer self righthand as alias__held_right
                if alias__held_right = var__weapon_armed_serial
                    @setvar! var__weapon_held 1
                endif
            endif

            if var__weapon_held = 0
                if find var__weapon_armed_serial backpack
                    dress var__weapon_armed_serial
                    if config__sysmsg = 1
                        sysmsg "PvP weapon: equip requested, graphic={{var__weapon_want}}, serial={{var__weapon_armed_serial}}." 88
                    endif
                    wait wait__short
                else
                    # Gone from hand and pack: search again next pass.
                    @setvar! var__weapon_armed_graphic 0
                    if lhandempty and rhandempty and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                        overhead "[ weapon, out ]" 254
                        settimer "timer__message" 0
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ---- module/base.razor -----------------------------------------------------------------------
    wait wait__poll
endwhile
